 "title": "Prépositions : in, on, at",
 "level": "A2",
 "topic": "Grammaire",
 "summary": "Le trio de la place et du temps, avec une règle simple et les exceptions courantes.",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "h",
   "text": "Le temps"
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "head": [
    "Préposition",
    "Utilisation",
    "Exemples"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "**at**",
     "heure précise, moment",
     "at 5 p.m., at night, at the weekend (UK), at Christmas"
    ],
    [
     "**on**",
     "jours et dates",
     "on Monday, on May 3rd, on Friday morning"
    ],
    [
     "**in**",
     "mois, saisons, années, périodes",
     "in June, in winter, in 2024, in the morning"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "tip",
   "text": "Le matin, l'après-midi, le soir : **in** the morning/afternoon/evening, mais **at** night."
  },
  {
   "type": "h",
   "text": "Le lieu : l'image d'un point, d'une surface, d'un volume"
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "head": [
    "Préposition",
    "Image",
    "Exemples"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "**at**",
     "un point précis",
     "at the door, at the station, at work, at home"
    ],
    [
     "**on**",
     "une surface / un étage",
     "on the table, on the second floor, on the screen"
    ],
    [
     "**in**",
     "un espace fermé / une zone",
     "in the office, in Paris, in France, in a car"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "h",
   "text": "Autres emplois utiles"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "items": [
    "**in** + durée : *I'll be back in two days* (dans deux jours).",
    "**for** = pendant, **during** + nom : *during the meeting*.",
    "**by** = avant / au plus tard : *by Friday*. **until** = jusqu'à.",
    "**on** a bus/train/plane, mais **in** a car/taxi."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "The meeting is at 10 a.m. on Tuesday.",
   "fr": "La réunion est à 10 h mardi."
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "I was born in March, in 1992.",
   "fr": "Je suis né en mars 1992."
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "She's at the station, waiting for the train.",
   "fr": "Elle est à la gare."
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "Put the file on my desk.",
   "fr": "Mets le fichier sur mon bureau."
  },
  {
   "type": "tip",
   "text": "**Piège** : « à Paris » → *in Paris* (une ville est une zone). *At* s'utilise pour un point précis : *at the airport.*"
  }
 ],
